    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "It's called metamorphosis. That's a big word for a really big change!",
      "punch": "metamorphosis",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "✨",
        "text": "Metamorphosis",
        "cue": "metamorphosis",
        "sub": "A really big change!",
        "sub_cue": "change"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Meta-what? How does it start?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "It starts as a tiny egg on a leaf. Out hatches a little caterpillar, and it gets right to work eating!",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "How it starts",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "🥚",
            "label": "A tiny egg on a leaf",
            "cue": "egg"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🐛",
            "label": "A caterpillar hatches",
            "cue": "hatches"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "What does it eat?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Leaves and more leaves! It eats so much it grows too big for its skin, so it wiggles out of it a few times.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🍃",
        "text": "Munch, munch, grow!",
        "cue": "eats",
        "sub": "It sheds its skin",
        "sub_cue": "skin"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "And then it turns into a butterfly?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Not yet! First it makes a hard case around itself, called a chrysalis. Like a wrapped-up present!",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🎁",
        "text": "The chrysalis",
        "cue": "chrysalis",
        "sub": "A wrapped-up present",
        "sub_cue": "present"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "What happens inside?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Something amazing! Its body changes almost completely. It builds wings, new legs and big new eyes.",
      "board": {
        "type": "gallery",
        "title": "Inside the chrysalis",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "🦋",
            "label": "Wings",
            "cue": "wings"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🦵",
            "label": "New legs",
            "cue": "legs"
          },
          {
            "icon": "👀",
            "label": "Big new eyes",
            "cue": "eyes"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "How does it get out?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "The chrysalis splits open, and out comes a butterfly! Its wings dry, then off it flies.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "Hello, butterfly!",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "🐣",
